{"id":"e06256d3696011c6","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-struwe.md","title":"Struwe's Theorem","display":"thm-struwe — Struwe's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-struwe","aliases":["58-thm-struwe"],"display":"thm-struwe — Struwe's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-energy-functional.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-compact-manifold.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-struwe"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-struwe</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-struwe — Struwe's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3db83908de2fd3e1\" href=\"?note=3db83908de2fd3e1\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map.md\">../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a1f6d4733dbaf832\" href=\"?note=a1f6d4733dbaf832\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-energy-functional.md\">../batch16/58-df-energy-functional.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md\">../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"871fa7428f3b8459\" href=\"?note=871fa7428f3b8459\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-compact-manifold.md\">../batch02/58-df-compact-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,g,\\tau_M,N,h,\\tau_N,n,u_0,U,s,t\\in V\">\\(M,g,\\tau_M,N,h,\\tau_N,n,u_0,U,s,t\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S\\)</span> are the cited set-level predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0\\in H^1(M,N)\">\\(u_0\\in H^1(M,N)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(U_t)\">\\(E(U_t)\\)</span> is the Dirichlet energy</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakHarmonicMapHeatFlow}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U;M,g,N,h,u_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakHarmonicMapHeatFlow}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U;M,g,N,h,u_0)\\)</span> means that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> solves <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial_tU=\\tau_{g,h}(U)\">\\(\\partial_tU=\\tau_{g,h}(U)\\)</span> distributionally with initial datum <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0\">\\(u_0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sing}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)=\\{(x,t)\\in M\\times(0,\\infty):U\\text{ is not smooth on any spacetime neighbourhood of }(x,t)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sing}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)=\\{(x,t)\\in M\\times(0,\\infty):U\\text{ is not smooth on any spacetime neighbourhood of }(x,t)\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}struwe}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,2)\n\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\n\\land\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(N,\\tau_N,n)\n\\land u_0\\in H^1(M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(U,M\\times[0,\\infty),N)\n\\land U(\\cdot,0)=u_0\n\\land\\mathrm{WeakHarmonicMapHeatFlow}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U;M,g,N,h,u_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n(s\\leq t\\to E(U_t)\\leq E(U_s))\n\\land|\\operatorname{Sing}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)|&lt;\\omega\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}struwe}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,2)\n\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\n\\land\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(N,\\tau_N,n)\n\\land u_0\\in H^1(M,N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(U,M\\times[0,\\infty),N)\n\\land U(\\cdot,0)=u_0\n\\land\\mathrm{WeakHarmonicMapHeatFlow}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U;M,g,N,h,u_0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n(s\\leq t\\to E(U_t)\\leq E(U_s))\n\\land|\\operatorname{Sing}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)|&lt;\\omega\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Struwe's surface theorem gives a global weak heat-flow solution, smooth away from finitely many spacetime singularities.</li>\n<li>Monotonicity: energy density decreases under scaling.</li>\n<li>bubbling: limit maps and bubbles at concentration points.</li>\n<li>It does not assert that every homotopy class contains an energy-minimizing harmonic map; bubbling can obstruct such a minimizer.</li>\n<li>The PDE and smooth-locus clauses remain explicitly metatheoretic because this book currently has no distribution-valued heat-flow or spacetime-regularity atom; they are not passed to a set-level predicate with a fabricated signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3db83908de2fd3e1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-harmonic-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-energy-functional.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1f6d4733dbaf832","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-energy-functional.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-compact-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"871fa7428f3b8459","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-compact-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,g,\\tau_M,N,h,\\tau_N,n,u_0,U,s,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"u_0\\in H^1(M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"E(U_t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakHarmonicMapHeatFlow}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U;M,g,N,h,u_0)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial_tU=\\tau_{g,h}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"u_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sing}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)=\\{(x,t)\\in M\\times(0,\\infty):U\\text{ is not smooth on any spacetime neighbourhood of }(x,t)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}struwe}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(M,\\tau_M,2)\n\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\n\\land\\mathrm{CompactManifold}_S(N,\\tau_N,n)\n\\land u_0\\in H^1(M,N)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(U,M\\times[0,\\infty),N)\n\\land U(\\cdot,0)=u_0\n\\land\\mathrm{WeakHarmonicMapHeatFlow}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U;M,g,N,h,u_0)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n(s\\leq t\\to E(U_t)\\leq E(U_s))\n\\land|\\operatorname{Sing}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)|<\\omega\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2219,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4446","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-struwe.md|58-thm-struwe]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["3db83908de2fd3e1","a1f6d4733dbaf832","04b9f5c6479b7ecd","38c58fda0da62833","871fa7428f3b8459","36d7463d215be751"]}